  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Siobhan Brennan",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:42:02-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:42:06-04:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello, thank you for picking up. I'm calling about a pothole on my street, thank you. It's gotten wicked bad since the rain Friday and Saturday, three days ago."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:42:14-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I'm sorry, you're breaking up a little. Which street is it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:42:18-04:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry, thank you. It's 414 Spring Street, in the Fifth Ward. [line breaks up] it's deep enough to swallow a tire, honestly."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:42:24-04:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "414 Spring Street, and the hole could swallow a tire. Did I get that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:42:29-04:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that's right, thank you. And now it's full of water, so you can't see it at all. I've watched two cars drop right into it. [inaudible] This is the third time I've called, thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:42:39-04:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm sorry, the last part cut out. You're asking for it to be added to the repair list?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:42:45-04:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes please, could you add Spring Street to the list? Thank you. I sit on my stoop to watch the tourists on weekends in summer, and somebody's going to wreck a car there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:42:54-04:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I've got it noted, 414 Spring Street, large water-filled pothole, requesting repair. I'll pass it to the crew."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:42:59-04:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you so much, I appreciate your help. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
